  "originalQuery": "Your team uses thousands of connected IoT devices to collect energy consumption data for your utility customers in real time. You want to design energy consumption analysis, demand forecasting, and resource allocation plans based on insights gathered from the data produced by these devices. You need a managed solution that is highly scalable, supports a multi-cloud strategy, and offers low latency for these IoT devices. What should you do?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Use Bigtable with Looker.<br/>B. Use Cloud Spanner with Data Studio.<br/>C. Use Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL with Data Studio.<br/>D. Use MongoDB Atlas with Charts.",
