  "tip": "<p>When a scenario emphasizes <i>multi cloud</i> and <i>low latency</i> for both ingestion and queries, favor fully managed services that operate across providers and natively support time series workloads. Watch for wording that implies vendor lock in and match the query pattern to the store.</p>",
